    "theorem": "BKFrobeniusBridgeAudit.actual_frobenius_bridge_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem actual_frobenius_bridge_certificate : (∀ (F L : Type) [Field F] [Fintype F] [Field L] [Algebra F L] [DecidableEq F] [DecidableEq L] [IsAlgClosed L] [NeZero (3:L)] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F), W.Δ≠0 → ∃ b : Basis (Fin 2) (ZMod 3) (ThreeTorsion (W.baseChange L)), (frobeniusMatrix W b).det≠0 ∧ (∀ c : Basis (Fin 2) (ZMod 3) (ThreeTorsion (W.baseChange L)), (frobeniusMatrix W b).det=(frobeniusMatrix W c).det) ∧ (∀ P : ThreeTorsion (W.baseChange L), frobeniusMatrix W b *ᵥ b.repr P=b.repr (linearFrobenius W P)) ∧ (∀ k : ℕ, (frobeniusMatrix W b)^k=1 ↔ ∀ P : (W.baseChange L).Point, (3:ℕ) • P=0 → (pointFrobenius W)^[k] P=P) ∧ (3 ∣ Nat.card W.Point → ∃ v : Fin 2 → ZMod 3, v≠0 ∧ frobeniusMatrix W b *ᵥ v=v) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [Fintype K] [Algebra F K] [Algebra K L] [IsScalarTower F K L] [DecidableEq K] (k : ℕ), Fintype.card K=Fintype.card F^k → ((∀ P : (W.baseChange L).Point, (3:ℕ) • P=0 → P∈Set.range (pointInclusion F K L W)) ↔ (frobeniusMatrix W b)^k=1) ∧ (3 ∣ Nat.card W.Point → (Fintype.card F : ZMod 3)≠1 → (frobeniusMatrix W b).det=(Fintype.card F : ZMod 3) → ((∀ P : (W.baseChange L).Point, (3:ℕ) • P=0 → P∈Set.range (pointInclusion F K L W)) ↔ 3 ∣ Fintype.card F^k-1)))) ∧ (CharP Binary.L 2 ∧ Binary.curve.Δ≠0 ∧ Nat.card Binary.curve.Point=3 ∧ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion (Binary.curve.baseChange Binary.L))=9 ∧ Binary.matrix.det=2 ∧ Binary.matrix^2=1 ∧ Binary.matrix≠1 ∧ ∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [Fintype K] [Algebra Binary.F K] [Algebra K Binary.L] [IsScalarTower Binary.F K Binary.L] [DecidableEq K] (k : ℕ), Fintype.card K=2^k → ((∀ P : (Binary.curve.baseChange Binary.L).Point, (3:ℕ) • P=0 → P∈Set.range (pointInclusion Binary.F K Binary.L Binary.curve)) ↔ 3 ∣ 2^k-1)) ∧ (∃ b : Basis (Fin 2) (ZMod 3) (ThreeTorsion (TorsionBoundaryAudit.bkCurve.baseChange ExcludedClosure)), frobeniusMatrix TorsionBoundaryAudit.bkCurve b≠1 ∧ (7:ZMod 3)^1=1)",
    "decl_sha256": "c9d4f116be22291b6e8aaa40934a0f06361c111e2ec3bff9c5d38902868ac1af",
    "scope": "Actual general geometric3torsion Frobenius representation and existing finitefield descent integration. Existential actual basis constructed for every nonsingular general Weierstrass model in every algclosedchar!=3, includingchar2. Actual coordinate q-Frobenius restriction/inducedZMod3linear map, actual Fin2matrix/repr/powers/basis-independentnonzerodeterminant. Actual rationalnonzero fixedvector from3|actualpointcard viaCauchy/injectiveactualinclusion. Actualchosenfinitefieldimage iffmatrixpoweridentity; qualifiedsource criterion explicitly conditional on actualdetq andqmod3!=1, not assumed geometry/rationality. ConcreteactualF2y²+y=x³+1/#3/geotor9/Frob²I/nonidentity/actualdet2/sourcecriterionforallchosen2^kfields/compatibleembeddings without determinantpremise. ExistingF7nonfixedwitness yieldsconstructedmatrixnonidentity/q1control. Genericactualdetq/canonicalpairings/otherprimes/fullBK/allkp500remainopen; noqualifiedsource-refutation/fullpaper/bookread/novelty/newnativeexperiment/spend/upload.",
